<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (Data Analytics refers to the systematic process of studying and interpreting data to uncover useful patterns, evaluate performance, and support effective decision-making. With organizations increasingly depending on data to guide their operations and strategies, the ability to organize, analyze, and interpret information has become an essential part of modern business practices. The field combines a variety of techniques, ranging from spreadsheet-based calculations and statistical analysis to programmatic data processing and interactive business intelligence reporting.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
