/P 102 0 R
/E (2)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 102 0 R
/T (Organizations collect substantial amounts of raw information through their routine business activities, yet such data becomes valuable only after it has been processed and interpreted to support meaningful decision-making. The central challenge addressed during this internship was understanding how raw, incomplete, or unorganized datasets can be transformed into useful and actionable business insights through a systematic analytical workflow:)
/E (Organizations collect substantial amounts of raw information through their routine business activities, yet such data becomes valuable only after it has been processed and interpreted to support meaningful decision-making. The central challenge addressed during this internship was understanding how raw, incomplete, or unorganized datasets can be transformed into useful and actionable business insights through a systematic analytical workflow:)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 102 0 R
/T (This workflow was implemented through practical activities throughout the internship: in Excel, by organizing and summarizing a large orders dataset using Pivot Tables and business metrics; in Python and Pandas, by examining a transactional dataset and independently cleaning an exercise-tracking dataset containing missing and duplicate records; and during the Week 4 capstone project, by processing a raw sales-transaction dataset through cleaning, validation, exploratory analysis, and business evaluation to generate meaningful findings and stakeholder-focused recommendations.)
/E (This workflow was implemented through practical activities throughout the internship: in Excel, by organizing and summarizing a large orders dataset using Pivot Tables and business metrics; in Python and Pandas, by examining a transactional dataset and independently cleaning an exercise-tracking dataset containing missing and duplicate records; and during the Week 4 capstone project, by processing a raw sales-transaction dataset through cleaning, validation, exploratory analysis, and business evaluation to generate meaningful findings and stakeholder-focused recommendations.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
