/P 109 0 R
/T (As an additional task, the cleaned dataset was filtered to include only records having Calories greater than 300, and this resulting subset was saved separately as filtered_data.csv. The exercise emphasized the significance of data preparation prior to analysis, as missing values, duplicate entries, and inconsistent formats may influence subsequent calculations and analytical results. It also reinforced the need to verify data quality before carrying out further transformations, filtering, or interpretation.)
/E (As an additional task, the cleaned dataset was filtered to include only records having Calories greater than 300, and this resulting subset was saved separately as filtered_data.csv. The exercise emphasized the significance of data preparation prior to analysis, as missing values, duplicate entries, and inconsistent formats may influence subsequent calculations and analytical results. It also reinforced the need to verify data quality before carrying out further transformations, filtering, or interpretation.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
