/Title (Organizations collect substantial amounts of raw information through their routine business activities, yet such data becomes valuable only after it has been processed and interpreted to support meaningful decision-making. The central challenge addressed during this internship was understanding how raw, incomplete, or unorganized datasets can be transformed into useful and actionable business insights through a systematic analytical workflow:)
