1041 0 obj
<<
/Title (Following the data-preparation process, the Date column, which was initially represented in an inconsistent text format, was transformed into a standardized datetime format. The single missing Date value was addressed through interpolation, while the two missing Calories entries were replaced with the mean value of the column. After these corrections, the dataset contained no remaining missing values. A new calculated field, Calories_Per_Minute, was generated by dividing Calories by Duration for each record. With the duplicate removed and the derived column added, the processed dataset contained 31 rows and 6 columns and was exported as cleaned_data.csv.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1017 0 R
/Prev 1040 0 R
/Next 1029 0 R
>>
endobj
